{
  "title": "Ziyarat-e-Ameenullah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Jabir ibne Abdullah Ansari (r.a.), the famous companion of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) reported that Imam Zainul Abedin (a.s.) and Imam Mohammed Baqir (a.s.) recited this Ziyarat in a state of lamentation and mourning near the grave of Imam Ali (a.s.). \nFurthermore they said:- For those amongst our Shias who recite this Dua and Ziyarat near the grave of Ameerul Momeneen – Imam Ali (a.s.) , Allah (s.w.t.) will write this action in their scroll of deeds with Noor (light) and this will be further adorned  by the seal of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.). He will then be placed in the protection of Hazrat-e-Qaem-e-Aal-e-Mohammed (a.t.f.s.) who will welcome him with honour and respect and give him glad tidings. (Ref: Mafateeh-ul-Jinaan) \nThis Ziyarat can also be recited near the shrine of other Holy Imams (a.s.).\nThe sentences of this Ziyarat seek acceptance of one’s desires, increase in sustenance, distancing from the enemies of Ahlebait (a.s.), contentment and protection from one’s enemies. Truly the benefits of reciting this Ziyarat are manifold.\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمِیْنَ اللّٰهِ فِیْ اَرْضِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEENALLAAHE FEE ARZEHI \nPeace be on You, O the trustee of Allah on His earth,\nوَ حُجَّتَہٗ عَلٰی عِبَادِهٖ \nWA HUJJATAHU A’LAA E’BAADEHI \nand His Proof over His servants.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEERAL MOMINEENA \nPeace be on you, O Ameerul Mu’mineen.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ جَاهَدْتَ فِی اللّٰهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهٖ \nASH-HADO ANNAKA JAAHADTA FILLAAHE HAQQA JEHAADEHI \nI bear witness that, you strived in the way of Allah what is due,\nوَ عَمِلْتَ بِکِتَابِهٖ وَ اتَّبَعْتَ سُنَنَ نَبِیِّهٖ \nWA A’MILTA BEKETAABEHI WAT TABA’-TA SONANA NABIYYEHI \nand you acted upon His Book, and followed the ways of His Prophet,\nصَلَّ اللهُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ حَتّٰی دَعَاكَ اللّٰهُ اِلٰی جِوَارِهٖ \nSALLALLAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI HATTAA DA-A’AKALLAAHO ELAA JEWAAREHI \nblessings of Allah be on him and his family, until Allah called You to His side.\nفَقَبَضَكَ اِلَیْهِ بِاِخْتِیَارِهٖ وَ اَلْزَمَ اَعْدَآئَكَ \nFAQABAZAKA ELAYHE BE-IKHTEYAAREHI WA ALZAMA AA’-DAAA-EKAL \nSo He took you to Him by His choice, and made incumbent upon your enemies\nالْحُجَّۃَ مَعَ مَا لَكَ مِنَ الْحُجَجِ الْبَالِغَةِ \nHUJJATA MA-A’ MAALAKA MENAL HOJAJIL BAALEGHATE \nthe proof, with what you have of the considerable proofs,\nعَلٰی جَمِیْعِ خَلْقِهٖ \nA’LAA JAMEE-E’ KHALQEHI \nover all of His creation.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَاجْعَلْ نَفْسِیْ مُطْمَئِنَّۃً بِقَدَرِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA FAJ-A’L NAFSEE MUTMA-INNATAN BEQADAREKA \nO Allah, then make my soul, satisfied with Your decree,\nرَآضِیَۃً بِقَضَآئِكَ مُوْلَعَۃً بِذِکْرِكَ وَ دُعَآئِكَ \nRAAZEYATAN BEQAZAAA-EKA MOOLA-A’TAN BEZIKREKA WA DO-A’AAA-EKA \npleased with what You have destined for me, fond of Your remembrance and supplications,\nمُحِبَّۃً لِصَفْوَةِ اَوْلِیَآئِكَ \nMOHIBBATAN LESAFWATE AWLEYAAA-EKA \nloving Your chosen friends.\nمَحْبُوْبَۃً فِیْ اَرْضِكَ وَ سَمَآئِكَ \nMAHBOOBATAN FEE ARZEKA WA SAMAAA-EKA \n(Let me be) well liked on Your earth and in Your heavens,\nصَابِرَۃً عِنْدَ نُزُوْلِ بَلَآئِكَ \nSAABERATAN A’LAA NOZOOLE BALAAA-EKA \npatient when You send down afflictions,\nشَاکِرَۃً لِفَوَاضِلِ نَعْمَآئِكَ \nSHAAKERATAN LEFAWAAZELE NAA’-MAAA-EKA \ngrateful for Your gracious blessings,\nذَاکِرَۃً لِسَوَابِغْ اٰلَآئِكَ \nZAAKERATAN LESAWAABEGHE AALAAA-EKA \nremembering Your abundant bounties,\nمُشْتَاقَۃً اِلٰی فَرْحَتِ لِقَآئِكَ \nMUSHTAAQATAN ELAA FARHATE LEQAAA-EKA \nyearning for the happiness of meeting with You,\nمُتَزَوِّدَۃً لِلْتَّقْوٰی لِیَوْمِ جَزَائِكَ \nMOTAZAWWEDATAN LIT-TAQWAA LEYAWME JAZAAA-EKA \nequipped with piety for the day of Your reward,\nمُسْتَنَّۃً بِسُنَنِ اَوْلِیَآئِكَ \nMUSTANNATAN BESONANE AWLEYAAA-EKA \nfollowing the manners of Your friends,\nمُفَارِقَۃً لِاَخْلاَقِ اَعْدَائِكَ \nMOFAAREQATAN LE-AKHLAAQE AA’-DAAA-EKA \navoiding the manners of Your enemies,\nمَشْغُوْلَۃً عَنِ الدُّنْیَا بِحَمْدِكَ وَ ثَنَآئِكَ \nMASHGHOOLATAN A’NID DUNYAA BEHAMDEKA WA SANAAA-EKA \ndiverted from the (love of) world by Your remembrance and Your praise.\nThis part of the Ziyaarat was read by our fourth Imam (a.s) while resting his cheek on the grave of Imam Ali (a.s)\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّ قُلُوْبَ الْمُخْبِتِیْنَ اِلَیْكَ وَالِهَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNA QOLOOBAL MUKHBETEENA ELAYKA WAALEHATUN \nO Allah, the hearts of those who humble themselves before You, are full of amazement.\nوَ سُبُلَ الرَّاغِبِیْنَ اِلَیْكَ شَارِعَۃٌ \nWA SOBOLAR RAAGHEBEENA ELAYKA SHAARE-A’TUN \nthe paths of those who desire You are fixed.\nوَاَعْلاَمَ الْقَاصِدِیْنَ اِلَیْكَ وَاضِحَۃٌ \nWA AA’-LAAMAL QAASEDEENA ELAYKA WAAZEHATUN \nThe signs for those who seek You are clear.\nوَ اَفْئِدَۃَ الْعَارِفِیْنَ مِنْكَ فَازِعَۃٌ \nWA AF-EDATAL A’AREFEENA MINKA FAAZE-A’TUN \nThe hearts of those who know You, are empty of other than You.\nوَ اَصْوَاتَ الدَّاعِیْنَ اِلَیْكَ صَاعِدَۃٌ \nWA ASWAATAD DAA-E’EENA ELAYKA SAA-E’DATUN \nThe sounds of those who call You rise to You,\nوَ اَبْوَابَ الْاِجَابَةِ لَهُمْ مُفَتَّحَۃٌ \nWA ABWAABAL EJAABATE LAHUM MOFATTAHATUN \nand the gates of answers are open for them.\nوَ دَعْوَۃَ مَنْ نَاجَاكَ مُسْتَجَابَۃٌ \nWA DAA’-WATA MAN NAAJAAKA MUSTAJAABATUN \nThe prayer of the one who whispers to you is answered.\nوَ تَوْبَۃَ مَنْ اَنَابَ اِلَیْكَ مَقْبُوْلَۃٌ \nWA TAWBATA MAN ANAABA ELAYKA MAQBOOLATUN \nThe repentance of the one who turns to You is accepted.\nوَ عَبْرَۃَ مَنْ بَکٰی مِنْ خَوْفِكَ مَرْحُوْمَۃٌ \nWA A’BRATA MAN BAKAA MIN KHAWFEKA MARHOOMATUN \nThe tears of the one who weeps in Your fear are dealt with mercifully.\nوَالْاِغَاثَۃَ لِمَنِ السْتَغَاثَ بِكَ مَوْجُوْدَۃٌ \nWAL EGHAASATA LEMANIS-TAGHAASA BEKA MAWJOODATUN \nHelp is available for one who cry for help from You,\nوَالْاِعَانَۃَ لِمَنِ اسْتَعَانَ بِكَ مَبْذُوْلَۃٌ \nWAL E-A’ANATA LEMANIS-TA-A’ANA BEKA MABZOOLATUN \nand assistance is given generously to the one who seeks it.\nوَ عِدَاتِكَ لِعِبَادِكَ مَنْجَزَۃٌ \nWA E’DAATEKA LE-E’BAADEKA MUNJAZATUN \nYour promises for Your servants are fulfilled.\nوَ زَلَلَ مَنِ اسْتَقَالَكَ مُقَالَۃٌ \nWA ZALALA MANIS-TAQAALAKA MOQAALATUN \nThe errors of the one who seeks to reduce them, are reduced.\nوَ اَعْمَالَ الْعَامِلِیْنَ لَدَیْكَ مَحْفُوْظَۃٌ \nWA AA’-MAALAL AA’-MELEENA LADAYKA MAHFOOZATUN \nThe actions of the doers (of good deeds), are preserved with You,\nوَ اَرْزَاقَ الْخَلَآئِقِ مِنْ لَدُنْكَ نَازِلَۃٌ \nWA ARZAAQAKA ELAL KHALAAA-EQE MIN LADUNKA NAAZELATUN \nand the provision for Your creatures comes down.\nوَ عَوَآئِدَ الْمَزِیْدِ اِلَیْهِمْ وَاصِلَۃٌ \nWA A’WAAA-EDAL MAZEEDE ELAYHIM WAASELATUN \nThe promises of increase (in provision) reach them,\nوَ ذُنُوْبَ الْمُسْتَغْفِرِیْنَ مَغْفُوْرَۃٌ \nWA ZONOOBAL MUSTAGHFEREENA MAGHFOORATUN \nThe sins of those who seek forgiveness are forgiven.\nوَ حَوَآئِجَ خَلْقِكَ عِنْدَكَ مَقْضِیَّۃٌ \nWA HAWAAA-EJA KHALQEKA I’NDAKA MAQZIYYATUN \nThe needs of Your creatures are fulfilled.\nوَ جَوَائِزِ السَّائِلِیْنَ عِنْدَكَ مُوَفَّرَۃٌ \nWA JAWAAA-EZAS SAA-ELEENA I’NDAKA MOWAFFARATUN \nThe rewards of the beseechers are available in plenty, with You.\nوَ عَوَائِدَ الْمَزِیْدِ عِنْدَكَ مُتَوَاتِرَۃٌ \nWA A’WAA-EDAL MAZEEDE MOTAWAATERATUN \nThe promises of increase are continous.\nوَ مَوَائِدَ الْمُسْتَطْعِمِیْنَ مُعَدَّۃٌ \nWA MAWAAA-EDAL MUSTAT-E’MEENA MO-A’DDATUN \nWholesome food is prepared for the hungry,\nوَ مَنَاهِلَ الظِّمَآءِ لَدَیْكَ مُتْرَعَۃٌ \nWA MANAAHELAZ ZEMAA-E MUTRA-A’TUN \nand drinks are filled for the thirsty.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَاسْتَجِبْ دُعَائِیْ وَ اَقْبَلْ ثَنَآئِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA FAS-TAJIB DO-A’AA-EE WAQBAL SANAA-EE \nO Allah, so answer my prayer, and accept my praise.\nوَاجْمَعْ بَیْنِیْ وَ بَیْنَ اَوْلِیَآئِیْ \nWAJ-MA’-BAYNEE WA BAYNA AWLEYAAA-EE \nUnite me with my friends,\nبِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ عَلِیٍّ وَ فَاطِمَۃَ \nBEHAQQE MOHAMMADINW WA A’LIYYIN WA FAATEMATA \nfor the sake of Mohammad, and Ali, and Fatimah,\nوَ الْحَسَنِ وَ الْحُسَیْنِ اِنَّكَ وَلِیُّ نَعْمَآئِیْ \nWAL HASANE WAL HUSAYNE INNAKA WALIYYO NA’-MAAA-EE \nHasan and Husayn (a.s). Surely You are, the Master of my bounties,\nوَ مُنْتَہٰی مُنَایَ وَ غَایَۃُ رَجَآئِیْ \nWA MUNTAHAA MUNAAYA WA GHAAYATO RAJAAA-EE \nthe object of my desires, the goal of my hopes,\nفِیْ مُنْقَلَبِیْ وَ مَثْوَایَ \nFEE MUNQALABEE WA MASWAAYA \nin my ultimate end and my stable abode.\nThen recite:\nاَنْتَ اِلٰهِیْ وَ سَیِّدِیْ وَ مَوْلَایَ \nANTA ELAAHEE WA SAYYEDEE WA MAWLAAYA \n(O Allah), You are my God, my Lord, and my Master.\nاِغْفِرْلِاَوْلِیَآئِنَا وَ کُفَّ عَنَّا اَعْدَآئَنَا \nIGHFIR LI-AWLEYAAA-ENAA WA KUFFA A’NNAA AA’-DAAA-ANAA \nForgive (the sins of ) our guardians, keep away our enemies from us,\nوَ اشْغَلْهُمْ عَنْ اَذَانَا \nWASHGHALHUM A’N AZAANAA \nand divert them from troubling us.\nوَ اَظْهِرْ كَلِمَۃَ الْحَقِّ \nWA AZHIR KALEMATAL HAQQE \nLet the word of Truth become manifest\nوَ اجْعَلْهَا الْعُلْیَا وَ اَدْحِضْ کَلِمَۃَ الْبَاطِلِ \nWAJ-A’LHAL U’LYAA WA ADHIZ KALEMATAL BAATELE \nand make it supreme, and let the word of falsehood be refuted\nوَ اجْعَلْهَا السُّفْلٰی اِنَّكَ عَلٰی کُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٌ \nWAJ-A’LHAS SUFLAA INNAKA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN \nand make it low, Surely You have power over all things."
}
